Package: lassovar
Title: Estimation and Forecasting of VAR Models with the Lasso
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Laurent", "Callot", email = "laurent.callot@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Functions for the estimation and forecasting of VAR models with the
    Lasso. This package is a wrapper for the glmnet package aimed at facilitating
    estimation and forecasting with VAR models. It provides estimation with the
    Lasso, adaptive Lasso, post-Lasso OLS, and methods for forecast combination.
Depends:
    R (>= 3.6.0)
Imports:
    glmnet (>= 4.0),
    Matrix,
    dplyr,
    tidyr,
    purrr,
    tibble,
    magrittr,
    rlang
Suggests:
    testthat
